flowchart TD
    U[User] --> UI[Streamlit Bug Submission UI]
    UI --> V[Validation and Attachment Text Extraction]
    V --> DB[(SQLite Bug Report Store)]
    V --> Q[Build Search Query]
    KB[Historical Defects JSONL] --> PRE[Text Preparation]
    PRE --> TF[TF-IDF Vectorizer]
    Q --> RET[Cosine Similarity Retrieval]
    TF --> RET
    RET --> ORCH[Agent Orchestrator]
    DB --> ORCH
    ORCH --> T[Triage Agent]
    T --> L[Log Analysis Agent]
    L --> D[Duplicate Detection Agent]
    D --> R[Root Cause Agent]
    R --> M[Remediation Agent]
    M --> OUT[Structured Diagnosis]
    OUT --> UI
